# An additional cost is paid with an alternative cost too (CR 118.9d, 601.2f). Bot1's Show and Tell puts Terror of the
# Peaks onto the battlefield, and Bot2 puts Omniscience. On turn 2 Bot2, with no land, casts Lightning Bolt at Terror without
# paying its mana cost: no mana, but Terror's additional 3 life still, so Bot2 is at 17.

[Bot1 Deck]
Island
Black Lotus
Show and Tell
Terror of the Peaks
Island x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Omniscience
Lightning Bolt x15

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Island.Play
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Blue)
Bot1.Hand.Show and Tell.Cast
Bot1.Choose(Terror of the Peaks)
Bot2.Choose(Omniscience)
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Lightning Bolt.Cast(Bot1.Battlefield.Terror of the Peaks; Ability: Without paying)
? Bot2.Life = 17
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass

[Expect]
Turn = 2
Bot2.Life = 17
Bot1.Battlefield.Terror of the Peaks.Damage = 3
Bot2.Battlefield = Omniscience
